        "accession_number": "0001261333-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We focused initially on selling our products to commercial businesses and VSBs and later expanded our focus to target enterprise customers.",
        "start_character": 1543,
        "end_character": 1682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001261333-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001261333-26-000021-aec12bef46988fcd",
        "accession_number": "0001261333-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate co-location data centers in several locations, and we also leverage public cloud infrastructure for an increasing number of services, as we continue to migrate our production services from our data center hosting facilities to Microsoft Azure Cloud, a third-party cloud provider.",
        "start_character": 24632,
        "end_character": 24922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001261333-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001261333-26-000021-aec12bef46988fcd",
        "accession_number": "0001261333-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Within our GTM strategy evolution, we are investing in deeper partner engagement across strategic technology partners like Microsoft, SAP, and Salesforce with whom we have both product integrations and co-selling relationships.",
        "start_character": 12314,
        "end_character": 12541
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001261333-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001261333-26-000021-aec12bef46988fcd",
        "accession_number": "0001261333-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we expect to continue to develop and enhance our strategic partnerships in key international markets as we grow internationally, with particular focus on IAM.",
        "start_character": 15883,
        "end_character": 16055
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001261333-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001261333-26-000021-aec12bef46988fcd",
