        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In November 2024, we hosted Docusign Discover, our first-ever developer-focused conference, and launched Docusign for Developers, giving our partners tools to build apps powered by the IAM platform.",
